+ * start.s and arm_vm_init map the window SWEET_EARLY_FB_PA (sweet_early.h): with 16K pages one 32MB
+ * block at 0x9c000000 (sweet 0x9c000000 1080x2400, Poco F1 0x9d400000 1080x2246); with 4K pages
+ * (patch 1022) six 2MB blocks at 0x9d400000 (Moto G6 Plus 1080x2160, Poco F1). sweet_early_set_video
+ * picks the framebuffer inside it from boot_args. Nothing is drawn while sweet_early_fb_mapped is 0
